@hostname = localhost
@port = 5115
@host = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}

### Realizar Checkin com vaga aleatória
POST {{host}}/api/ticket/checkin
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"licensePlate": "BRA2E24",
	"model": "Onix",
	"color": "Branco",
	"parkingSpotId": null
}

### Realizar Check-in com vaga específica
POST {{host}}/api/ticket/checkin
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"licensePlate": "BRA3K56",
	"model": "HB20",
	"color": "Preto",
	"parkingSpotId": 3
}


### Ver vagas (Dashboard)
GET {{host}}/api/parkingspot/dashboard

### Simular Check-out (Preview)
GET {{host}}/api/ticket/checkout/preview/1

### Confirmar Check-out
POST {{host}}/api/ticket/checkout/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"exitTime": ""
}

### Listar vagas
GET {{host}}/api/parkingspot

### Criar vaga
POST {{host}}/api/parkingspot
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"spotNumber": "X-99"
}

### Excluir vaga
DELETE {{host}}/api/parkingspot/11
